    {
      "source": "Entry point for builder style <a href=\"CouchbaseCacheManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.cache\"><code>CouchbaseCacheManager</code></a> configuration.",
      "translation": "构建器风格<a href=\"CouchbaseCacheManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.cache\"><code>CouchbaseCacheManager</code></a>配置的入口点。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "Define a default <a href=\"CouchbaseCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.cache\"><code>CouchbaseCacheConfiguration</code></a> applied to dynamically created <a href=\"CouchbaseCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.cache\"><code>CouchbaseCache</code></a>s.",
      "translation": "定义一个默认应用于动态创建的<a href=\"CouchbaseCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.cache\"><code>CouchbaseCache</code></a>的<a href=\"CouchbaseCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.cache\"><code>CouchbaseCacheConfiguration</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Get the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Set.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Set</code></a> of cache names for which the builder holds <a href=\"CouchbaseCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.cache\"><code>configuration</code></a>.",
      "translation": "获取构建器持有<a href=\"CouchbaseCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.cache\"><code>configuration</code></a>的缓存名称的<code>Set</code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Set.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Append a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> of cache name/<a href=\"CouchbaseCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.cache\"><code>CouchbaseCacheConfiguration</code></a> pairs to be pre initialized.",
      "translation": "附加一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>Map</code></a>，用于预初始化缓存名称与<a href=\"CouchbaseCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.couchbase.cache 中的类\"><code>CouchbaseCacheConfiguration</code></a> 的键值对。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create new instance of <a href=\"CouchbaseCacheManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.cache\"><code>CouchbaseCacheManager</code></a> with configuration options applied.",
      "translation": "使用已应用的配置选项创建新的<a href=\"CouchbaseCacheManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.cache\"><code>CouchbaseCacheManager</code></a>实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Disable in-flight <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/Cache.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>Cache</code></a> creation for unconfigured caches.",
      "translation": "禁用未配置缓存的飞行中<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/Cache.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>Cache</code></a>创建。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Get the <a href=\"CouchbaseCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.cache\"><code>CouchbaseCacheConfiguration</code></a> for a given cache by its name.",
      "translation": "通过名称获取给定缓存的<a href=\"CouchbaseCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.cache\"><code>CouchbaseCacheConfiguration</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Enable <a href=\"CouchbaseCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.cache\"><code>CouchbaseCache</code></a>s to synchronize cache put/evict operations with ongoing Spring-managed\ntransactions.",
      "translation": "使<a href=\"CouchbaseCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.cache\"><code>CouchbaseCache</code></a>能够将缓存的写入/删除操作与正在进行的 Spring 管理的交易进行同步。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"CouchbaseCacheManager.html#getMissingCache(java.lang.String)\"><code>CouchbaseCacheManager.getMissingCache(String)</code></a> returns null for any unconfigured\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/Cache.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>Cache</code></a> instead of a new <a href=\"CouchbaseCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.cache\"><code>CouchbaseCache</code></a> instance. This allows eg.\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/support/CompositeCacheManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache.support\"><code>CompositeCacheManager</code></a> to chime in.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"CouchbaseCacheManager.html#getMissingCache(java.lang.String)\"><code>CouchbaseCacheManager.getMissingCache(String)</code></a> 对于任何未配置的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/Cache.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>Cache</code></a> 返回 null，而不是创建一个新的 <a href=\"CouchbaseCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.cache\"><code>CouchbaseCache</code></a> 实例。这使得例如 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/support/CompositeCacheManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache.support\"><code>CompositeCacheManager</code></a> 能够介入处理。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Append a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Set.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Set</code></a> of cache names to be pre initialized with current <a href=\"CouchbaseCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.cache\"><code>CouchbaseCacheConfiguration</code></a>.\n<strong>NOTE:</strong> This calls depends on <a href=\"#cacheDefaults(org.springframework.data.couchbase.cache.CouchbaseCacheConfiguration)\"><code>cacheDefaults(CouchbaseCacheConfiguration)</code></a> using whatever\ndefault <a href=\"CouchbaseCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.cache\"><code>CouchbaseCacheConfiguration</code></a> is present at the time of invoking this method.",
      "translation": "向缓存名称集合中添加一个<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Set.html\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>Set</code></a>，该集合将使用当前的<a href=\"CouchbaseCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.couchbase.cache 中的类\"><code>CouchbaseCacheConfiguration</code></a>进行预初始化。\n<strong>注意：</strong>此调用依赖于<a href=\"#cacheDefaults(org.springframework.data.couchbase.cache.CouchbaseCacheConfiguration)\"><code>cacheDefaults(CouchbaseCacheConfiguration)</code></a>，并使用在调用此方法时存在的任何默认<a href=\"CouchbaseCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.couchbase.cache 中的类\"><code>CouchbaseCacheConfiguration</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Append a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Set.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Set</code></a> of cache names to be pre initialized with current <a href=\"CouchbaseCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.cache\"><code>CouchbaseCacheConfiguration</code></a>.",
      "translation": "向缓存名称集合中添加一个<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Set.html\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>Set</code></a>，该集合将使用当前的<a href=\"CouchbaseCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.couchbase.cache 中的类\"><code>CouchbaseCacheConfiguration</code></a>进行预初始化。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "an unmodifiable <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Set.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Set</code></a> holding the name of caches for which a <a href=\"CouchbaseCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.cache\"><code>configuration</code></a> has been set.",
      "translation": "一个不可修改的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Set.html\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>Set</code></a>，其中持有已设置<a href=\"CouchbaseCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.couchbase.cache 中的类\"><code>configuration</code></a>的缓存名称。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html#empty()\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Optional.empty()</code></a> if no <a href=\"CouchbaseCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.cache\"><code>CouchbaseCacheConfiguration</code></a> set for the given cache name.",
      "translation": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html#empty()\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>Optional.empty()</code></a>，如果未为给定的缓存名称设置 <a href=\"CouchbaseCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.couchbase.cache 中的类\"><code>CouchbaseCacheConfiguration</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
